--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Changes made for orvara (see __init__.py):
  * six occurrences of the removed NumPy alias `np.float` replaced with the
    builtin `float`
  * docstrings containing LaTeX escapes made raw strings, to silence Python
    3.12 SyntaxWarnings
  * `from . import util` rewritten as an absolute import
The sampling algorithm is unmodified.
